 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The version is ready. Today we publish a release. The team talks about the cloud service at the standup. When I use the virtual server, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the release with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the release note. At the table, Maria says, \"I see your point.\" I think, then answer, \"I have a different view.\" With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "tts": "The version is ready. Today we publish a release. The team talks about the cloud service at the standup. When I use the virtual server, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the release with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the release note. At the table, Maria says, \"I see your point.\" I think, then answer, \"I have a different view.\" With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "版本准备好了。今天我们发布一个正式版本。团队在站会上讨论了云服务。使用虚拟服务器时，我向 Maria 请教。我把发布和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在发布说明里找一个细节。桌边，Maria说：\"我明白你的观点。\"我想了想，回答：\"我有不同的看法。\"在团队的帮助下，问题变小了。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "cloud service",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "云服务，通过互联网提供的计算或存储能力"
    },
    {
     "w": "virtual server",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "虚拟服务器，在物理机器中模拟出的独立服务器"
    },
    {
     "w": "I see your point.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我明白你的观点。"
    },
    {
     "w": "I have a different view.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我有不同的看法。"
    },
    {
     "w": "release",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "发布，把一个可用版本正式提供给用户"
    },
    {
     "w": "release note",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "发布说明，介绍新版本的变化"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I have a different view, and I say it politely. Priya starts with \"Could we look at another option?\" and I continue with \"I'm not sure I agree.\" I compare the container with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the container image. After lunch, I check the version tag again. Before the meeting, I review the semantic versioning one more time. The work is not easy, but I keep going.",
   "tts": "I have a different view, and I say it politely. Priya starts with \"Could we look at another option?\" and I continue with \"I'm not sure I agree.\" I compare the container with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the container image. After lunch, I check the version tag again. Before the meeting, I review the semantic versioning one more time. The work is not easy, but I keep going.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我有不同的看法，我礼貌地说了出来。Priya先说了\"我们可以看看另一个方案吗？\"我接着说：\"我不确定我是否同意。\"我把容器和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在容器镜像里找一个细节。午饭后，我又检查了一遍版本标签。开会前，我又复习了一遍语义化版本。工作不容易，但我继续前进。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "container",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "容器，把应用和依赖封装在一起的运行环境"
    },
    {
     "w": "container image",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "容器镜像，用来创建容器的只读模板"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could we look at another option?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我们可以看看另一个方案吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "I'm not sure I agree.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我不确定我是否同意。"
    },
    {
     "w": "version tag",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "版本标签，为某次提交添加版本标记"
    },
    {
     "w": "semantic versioning",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "语义化版本，用主版本、次版本和修订号表达变化"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. The team talks about the pre-release at the standup. Before I publish a release, I read the note. I compare the host machine with my notes. I start a container, and Priya watches the result. At the table, Maria says, \"Let's compare the evidence.\" I think, then answer, \"That sounds reasonable.\" The release is out. Users can see the new feature.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. The team talks about the pre-release at the standup. Before I publish a release, I read the note. I compare the host machine with my notes. I start a container, and Priya watches the result. At the table, Maria says, \"Let's compare the evidence.\" I think, then answer, \"That sounds reasonable.\" The release is out. Users can see the new feature.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我回顾了今天做的事。团队在站会上讨论了预发布版本。在发布版本之前，我先看了说明。我把宿主机和我的笔记做了比较。我启动容器，Priya 在旁边看结果。桌边，Maria说：\"我们比较一下证据吧。\"我想了想，回答：\"听起来有道理。\"版本发布了。用户能看到新功能了。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "host machine",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "宿主机，实际运行虚拟机或容器的机器"
    },
    {
     "w": "start a container",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "启动容器，根据镜像创建并运行容器"
    },
    {
     "w": "Let's compare the evidence.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我们比较一下证据吧。"
    },
    {
     "w": "That sounds reasonable.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "听起来有道理。"
    },
    {
     "w": "pre-release",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "预发布版本，在正式发布前供测试的版本"
    },
    {
     "w": "publish a release",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "发布版本，在 GitHub 上创建正式发布页面"
    }
   ]
  }
